    <section class="su-faq" id="faq">
      <div class="su-faq__inner">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="su-faq__list">
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>What information is required to apply?</summary>
            <p>You'll need your legal business information (name, EIN, address), owner details (name, SSN last 4, DOB), processing volume estimates, and bank routing and account numbers for deposit setup.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>Why do you need my routing and account number?</summary>
            <p>Your bank information is required to set up your deposit account so that processed funds can be deposited directly into your business bank account. This information is transmitted securely and used exclusively for funding setup.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>How secure is my information?</summary>
            <p>All data submitted through this application is protected with 256-bit SSL encryption. We are a PCI Level 1 compliant organization and follow strict data handling protocols. Your information is used solely for merchant account underwriting and setup.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>What happens after I apply?</summary>
            <p>After you submit your application, our underwriting team reviews your information. A dedicated specialist will contact you within 1–2 business days to discuss your account, finalize details, and complete the onboarding process.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>Will someone contact me if something is missing?</summary>
            <p>Yes. If any information is incomplete or additional documentation is needed (such as a voided check or business license), a specialist will reach out to you directly to collect the required items.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="su-faq__item">
            <summary>How long does approval take?</summary>
            <p>Most applications are reviewed within 1–2 business days. Some complex business types may require additional review, but your specialist will keep you informed throughout the process.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
